=== meta ===
rule: TEST_PATCHES_SUBJECT
title: an HTTP client's patch method is no patcher, whatever its argument
origin: #196 188.5 C control - httpx tests call client.patch(server.url, ...); a computed target is read only from a patcher, so an HTTP PATCH request records no patch
=== before: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app import billing


def test_invoice_total(client, server):
    items = [10.0, 90.0]
    assert billing.invoice_total(items, 0.053) == 105.3
=== after: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app import billing


def test_invoice_total(client, server):
    client.patch(server.url, content=b"total")
    items = [10.0, 90.0]
    assert billing.invoice_total(items, 0.053) == 105.3
=== head: src/app/billing.py ===
def invoice_total(items, tax):
    return round(sum(items) * (1 + tax), 2)
